- Never use React Polaris (`@shopify/polaris`) components — use Polaris web components (`<s-*>`)
- Never modify `auth.*.tsx` routes or `Session` model
- Never use raw HTML for layout in admin routes
- Never leave placeholder code — build it fully
- Never skip the validation checklist

