            </s-text>
          </s-box>
        </s-stack>
      </s-section>

      <s-section slot="aside" heading="FAQ">
        <s-stack direction="block" gap="base">
          <s-stack direction="block" gap="small-200">
            <s-text>Can I switch plans anytime?</s-text>
            <s-text tone="neutral">Yes. Upgrade instantly, downgrade at end of billing period.</s-text>
          </s-stack>
          <s-stack direction="block" gap="small-200">
            <s-text>What happens to my charts if I downgrade?</s-text>
            <s-text tone="neutral">Charts are never deleted. On Free, only the 3 most recent stay published.</s-text>
          </s-stack>
          <s-stack direction="block" gap="small-200">
            <s-text>Is there a free trial?</s-text>
            <s-text tone="neutral">The free plan is permanent — not a trial. Upgrade when you need more.</s-text>
          </s-stack>
        </s-stack>
      </s-section>
    </s-page>
  );
}

